WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
video file & English subtitles: Safex
fixed by fofiko1 and Rémi

00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:09.441
Candy tried her best to comfort Belle.

00:00:09.743 --> 00:00:13.939
Belle's mother was arrested
for committing a murder.

00:00:14.089 --> 00:00:17.209
Belle didn't know what had happened.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:27.859
A special menu for one hundred people.

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:32.058
- Mom... Mom!
- Belle...

00:00:32.232 --> 00:00:35.026
Your mom has something important to do.

00:00:35.176 --> 00:00:36.194
- Work?
- Yes.

00:00:36.344 --> 00:00:39.931
Belle, you know mom cooks great, right?

00:00:40.081 --> 00:00:45.000
A famous man in town asked her
to cook some nice dishes for him.

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:46.972
Will she come back?

00:00:47.122 --> 00:00:56.979
- Of course.
- How long will I have to sleep?

00:00:57.424 --> 00:00:59.718
Two days?

00:00:59.868 --> 00:01:02.853
There are two men hiring her.

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:10.028
If I sleep for these days?

00:01:10.178 --> 00:01:14.233
One more day.

00:01:17.745 --> 00:01:23.679
- Belle...
- Then she will come back.

00:01:24.651 --> 00:01:30.419
I am silly, I can't count.

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:38.089
Belle, be good.
Mom will be back soon.

00:01:38.239 --> 00:01:40.507
Yes!

00:01:40.657 --> 00:01:43.830
Belle!
Belle, where are you going?

00:01:55.990 --> 00:01:58.444
Kurin, where is Belle?

00:01:59.985 --> 00:02:02.790
Is she in there?

00:02:11.364 --> 00:02:13.526
I will be a good girl.

00:02:14.926 --> 00:02:18.472
I will help you too.

00:02:25.001 --> 00:02:28.472
You don't have to, Kurin!

00:02:39.225 --> 00:02:42.956
- Miss.
- Please, sit down inspector.

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:45.723
I have heard you catched a murderer?

00:02:45.873 --> 00:02:47.092
- Thanks to you.
- It was my duty.

00:02:47.242 --> 00:02:51.129
Was Candy arrested as well?

00:02:51.279 --> 00:02:52.864
Inspector?

00:02:53.014 --> 00:02:56.134
- No.
- You didn't catch her?

00:02:56.284 --> 00:02:59.610
Wasn't Candy hiding the escapee?

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:01.940
The evidence was clear.

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:05.977
The report says

00:03:06.127 --> 00:03:10.580
that those workers at the rail site
didn't know anything about Margot.

00:03:11.691 --> 00:03:14.419
Isn't the escapee called Arthur?

00:03:14.569 --> 00:03:16.688
No, it's a woman called Margot.

00:03:16.838 --> 00:03:21.259
What? Please wait.
Let me get the evidence!

00:03:29.542 --> 00:03:32.771
Where's the letter?

00:03:34.842 --> 00:03:36.771
Found it!

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:40.246
What are you doing, Eliza?

00:03:41.396 --> 00:03:46.486
Archie! May I borrow your chess?

00:03:46.793 --> 00:03:52.095
- What is in your hands?
- I am not hiding anything!

00:03:52.398 --> 00:03:53.763
- Wait!
- It hurts!

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:58.496
Let me see!
This is the letter from Candy...

00:03:58.646 --> 00:03:59.264
It must be then...

00:03:59.414 --> 00:04:02.600
It seems you went to the police
station just for this.

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:04.869
Let me go. Somebody!

00:04:05.019 --> 00:04:07.639
Yell as much as you want,
it will only bring you more shame.

00:04:07.789 --> 00:04:11.644
You entered my room without
my permission and read my letter.

00:04:14.821 --> 00:04:17.115
What do you want me to do?

00:04:17.265 --> 00:04:20.284
Tell everyone
about your conspiracy.

00:04:22.895 --> 00:04:24.856
At last, I finished washing the dishes.

00:04:25.006 --> 00:04:29.027
- Mom would have finished that quicker.
- Belle, you are pretty fast too.

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:34.365
Kurin, thank you.

00:04:34.515 --> 00:04:36.768
Candy, I have something to tell you.

00:04:36.918 --> 00:04:40.569
Mr. Nelson... Yes.

00:04:40.719 --> 00:04:44.274
Kurin, play with Belle.

00:04:51.524 --> 00:04:55.117
Tomorrow, I need you
to take Belle to the city.

00:04:55.267 --> 00:04:57.526
Belle?

00:04:58.364 --> 00:05:04.526
I must find someone to replace Margot
as soon as possible. Everybody is starving.

00:05:06.873 --> 00:05:08.967
You should go to this office.

00:05:09.117 --> 00:05:12.082
They will make arrangements for Belle.

00:05:12.232 --> 00:05:15.908
Where is Belle going?

00:05:16.316 --> 00:05:18.409
Her mother is in prison.

00:05:18.559 --> 00:05:21.846
She can't stay here for long.

00:05:21.996 --> 00:05:28.353
- You are sending Belle away?
- I have no choice.

00:05:28.503 --> 00:05:30.321
Mr. Nelson...

00:05:30.471 --> 00:05:33.791
I will take Margot's place!

00:05:33.941 --> 00:05:37.165
- Will you be cooking for all of us?
- Yes!

00:05:37.337 --> 00:05:41.080
Of course,
I will be a good nurse too.

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:45.036
Don't joke.

00:05:45.186 --> 00:05:48.478
I am serious!
Please, let Belle stay here!

00:05:49.115 --> 00:05:52.977
- Can you cook?
- Of course!

00:05:53.127 --> 00:05:56.748
They used to call me cooking genius.

00:05:56.898 --> 00:06:04.255
You just cooked for two or three people.

00:06:04.405 --> 00:06:06.958
No, I have cooked for
more than ten people before.

00:06:07.108 --> 00:06:10.028
But, here there are
more than a hundred workers!

00:06:10.178 --> 00:06:14.098
Leave it to me!
You should know

00:06:14.248 --> 00:06:17.566
that the number of people
doesn't matter.

00:06:20.113 --> 00:06:25.415
I knew it was going to be hard
but 100 people, that's a lot!

00:06:26.652 --> 00:06:31.248
If Mr. Albert was here to help me!

00:06:32.058 --> 00:06:36.518
- Candy, the water is boiling!
- Yes, yes...

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:40.597
I still have to slice the onions.

00:06:41.934 --> 00:06:44.128
Let me help!

00:06:44.278 --> 00:06:49.038
No, kids shouldn't play with knives.

00:06:53.112 --> 00:06:54.739
Was that necessary?

00:06:54.889 --> 00:06:57.141
I am hungry. Isn't it ready yet?

00:06:57.291 --> 00:07:00.617
We are starving!

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:03.848
Don't make us hungry.

00:07:03.998 --> 00:07:06.184
Sorry, just a little longer!

00:07:06.334 --> 00:07:12.391
- Wait... Candy is cooking!
- But can she cook?

00:07:12.932 --> 00:07:15.825
If there is any problem,
I am a nurse!

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:21.231
- Don't scare us, Candy!
- Sorry for keeping you waiting!

00:07:27.101 --> 00:07:29.306
Today's special menu...

00:07:31.215 --> 00:07:34.611
- Creamy corn soup!
- I want that!

00:07:35.822 --> 00:07:43.759
- Don't push, please!
- Stand one by one!

00:07:45.598 --> 00:07:48.590
I want a big bowl.

00:07:49.168 --> 00:07:51.227
Here, it's full.

00:07:55.274 --> 00:07:57.606
Please, I want a big bowl.

00:08:05.785 --> 00:08:08.413
- Please.
- Yes.

00:08:10.389 --> 00:08:13.449
- This soup is great!
- Of course, Candy cooked it!

00:08:16.529 --> 00:08:18.997
Hurry up.

00:08:19.899 --> 00:08:22.129
What?

00:08:30.443 --> 00:08:34.934
- What is this?
- It's not enough!

00:08:35.084 --> 00:08:38.910
Be quiet, it's just the appetizer,
right, Candy?

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:41.979
You will serve the main course now?

00:08:42.129 --> 00:08:45.683
Sorry, that's all.

00:08:46.993 --> 00:08:49.928
Oh yeah, we still have bread.

00:08:50.496 --> 00:08:55.927
Right, we will have
bread with butter today.

00:08:56.077 --> 00:08:58.830
Not anymore.

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:05.410
I know, you over toasted it, right?
Over toasted bread is nice, right guys?

00:09:06.345 --> 00:09:07.738
No... I forgot.

00:09:11.688 --> 00:09:13.680
God!

00:09:18.117 --> 00:09:20.785
I warned you.

00:09:20.995 --> 00:09:28.995
- Sorry, this won't happen tomorrow.
- You want to try again?

00:09:29.268 --> 00:09:31.095
Can I?

00:09:31.245 --> 00:09:35.334
Candy, the men
are working really hard here.

00:09:39.211 --> 00:09:41.339
They are working in the dark
the whole day.

00:09:41.489 --> 00:09:43.905
Eating is their only enjoyment.

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:48.145
If you feed them with fodder
what will they think?

00:09:48.295 --> 00:09:52.316
Do you think this is good?

00:09:53.626 --> 00:09:59.087
- Yes.
- Candy, do you have parents?

00:09:59.966 --> 00:10:07.463
- No.
- Me neither. They passed away.

00:10:08.074 --> 00:10:10.907
Mr. Nelson...

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:14.876
But, I became the foreman.

00:10:16.215 --> 00:10:19.814
You became a good nurse, didn't you?

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:24.563
Belle will be like us.

00:10:24.713 --> 00:10:27.852
Even without parents, she will succeed.

00:10:28.002 --> 00:10:32.223
- But...
- Take Belle away tomorrow, ok?

00:10:33.673 --> 00:10:36.346
Yes.

00:10:45.206 --> 00:10:48.940
- Belle...
- Candy, are you hungry?

00:10:49.090 --> 00:10:51.943
Oh yes, we haven't had anything.

00:10:52.351 --> 00:10:56.654
Wait, I will cook something for you.

00:11:15.508 --> 00:11:17.535
Take care, Belle.

00:11:17.685 --> 00:11:20.037
You too, Mr. Nelson.

00:11:20.187 --> 00:11:22.808
Bye bye, Kurin!

00:11:23.008 --> 00:11:26.920
- See you, Candy.
- Yes.

00:11:30.383 --> 00:11:35.920
Good bye, Mr. Nelson!

00:11:57.016 --> 00:11:58.442
It's really fast.

00:11:58.592 --> 00:12:01.245
Belle, are you happy
to go to the town?

00:12:01.395 --> 00:12:04.348
Yes, because mother is there.

00:12:04.498 --> 00:12:08.319
Belle... you thought we were going
to see your mother?

00:12:08.469 --> 00:12:12.657
I will help mom with her cooking.

00:12:12.807 --> 00:12:15.390
It's rabbit!

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:22.198
It left with its mom.

00:12:22.475 --> 00:12:23.854
Yes.

00:12:27.505 --> 00:12:34.454
Uncle! Speed up, hurry!

00:12:35.788 --> 00:12:41.920
I can't tell her I am taking her
to the orphanage to be adopted.

00:13:00.012 --> 00:13:03.509
The train is late.

00:13:03.659 --> 00:13:05.744
Can we still go to the town, Candy?

00:13:05.994 --> 00:13:09.820
It's so cold,
let's go in the waiting room.

00:13:11.090 --> 00:13:12.316
What happened?

00:13:12.466 --> 00:13:17.521
- It should have arrived three hours ago.
- Why isn't the train coming?

00:13:17.671 --> 00:13:19.171
I don't know.

00:13:22.171 --> 00:13:26.580
If the train doesn't come,
Belle won't have to leave.

00:13:29.130 --> 00:13:32.937
Are we going back
if the train doesn't come?

00:13:33.087 --> 00:13:34.638
Don't even think about it.

00:13:34.788 --> 00:13:38.709
Mr. Nelson will be troubled.

00:13:38.859 --> 00:13:40.784
Mr. Nelson?

00:13:40.987 --> 00:13:45.483
Without food or fuel,
how are we supposed to go back?

00:13:46.358 --> 00:13:50.254
The train!
The train's coming!

00:14:01.006 --> 00:14:06.911
I heard it. It's coming!

00:14:09.348 --> 00:14:15.815
- Indeed!
- Finally!

00:14:22.495 --> 00:14:28.359
Graytown! Graytown! Last stop!

00:14:28.509 --> 00:14:31.595
Hey, are there any passengers today?

00:14:31.745 --> 00:14:36.208
A young lady in your age.

00:14:36.670 --> 00:14:41.208
- A young lady?
- Yes! Please, come out!

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:47.208
- Annie!
- Candy!

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:48.708
I'm so happy to see you!

00:14:48.988 --> 00:14:53.484
Annie! Archie is here too!

00:14:53.634 --> 00:14:56.551
Good to see you!

00:14:56.962 --> 00:15:00.391
I see,
Eliza gave my letter to the police.

00:15:00.541 --> 00:15:03.093
Maybe because
if Candy was hiding a murderer,

00:15:03.243 --> 00:15:05.529
she would be arrested.

00:15:05.679 --> 00:15:12.305
- Yes. I was worried.
- So you guys came to see me.

00:15:12.544 --> 00:15:14.738
Thank God,
Arthur could escape from that.

00:15:14.888 --> 00:15:19.678
But Belle's mother was arrested.

00:15:20.386 --> 00:15:23.280
So you are going to see your mom.

00:15:23.430 --> 00:15:27.758
You will have to speed up.

00:15:27.927 --> 00:15:32.364
Ok, we will go talk to the driver.

00:15:32.965 --> 00:15:36.160
Eliza gave us trouble again.

00:15:36.310 --> 00:15:39.796
- Candy, I know how to help Belle.
- How?

00:15:40.739 --> 00:15:44.068
Leave the cooking to us.

00:15:44.218 --> 00:15:45.769
That makes sense.

00:15:45.919 --> 00:15:53.344
- But we are talking about 110 people.
- It's alright, we can manage.

00:15:53.494 --> 00:15:54.745
Besides, you need to go back to Chicago

00:15:54.895 --> 00:15:57.765
or your families will get worried.

00:15:57.915 --> 00:15:59.550
Don't worry about it.

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:03.387
They went skiing in the mountains.

00:16:03.537 --> 00:16:05.923
Let's do this, Candy.

00:16:06.073 --> 00:16:08.626
I am so grateful!

00:16:08.776 --> 00:16:12.660
I hope our skills
can match yours, Candy.

00:16:15.808 --> 00:16:18.168
Belle, let's go back.

00:16:18.318 --> 00:16:20.738
We won't be able to see your mom
even if we go to the city.

00:16:20.888 --> 00:16:22.640
No, I want to go.

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:27.278
Your mother will come back.
Let's wait for her at home.

00:16:27.428 --> 00:16:29.981
Candy, you are lying!

00:16:30.222 --> 00:16:35.421
- Belle, listen to me.
- The train is leaving.

00:16:36.895 --> 00:16:42.731
- Belle, let's not take the train.
- No!

00:16:42.935 --> 00:16:49.869
Belle, your mother might be
on her way home now.

00:16:50.019 --> 00:16:56.278
- Mother?
- You don't want to miss her, do you?

00:16:58.650 --> 00:17:01.078
I will go back with you.

00:17:01.228 --> 00:17:03.849
Is mom really coming home?

00:17:06.658 --> 00:17:13.894
- Absolutely.
- Candy, I believe you.

00:17:16.001 --> 00:17:18.435
Why is my order not followed?

00:17:18.804 --> 00:17:20.397
But...

00:17:20.547 --> 00:17:23.566
They are good at cooking.

00:17:26.843 --> 00:17:28.839
Don't be rude.

00:17:28.989 --> 00:17:32.109
Is this a great cook's hand?

00:17:32.259 --> 00:17:33.344
No, Annie is a natural.

00:17:33.494 --> 00:17:36.752
It's just that her family
won't let her work.

00:17:37.389 --> 00:17:40.584
That's right, me too.

00:17:40.734 --> 00:17:43.367
What? What did you say?

00:17:43.517 --> 00:17:46.290
Are you not a man?

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:52.696
- Of course I am.
- Your hands look like a doll's hands.

00:17:52.846 --> 00:17:55.599
- Go back.
- Mr. Nelson!

00:17:55.749 --> 00:17:57.668
What?

00:17:57.818 --> 00:18:04.074
- Don't judge people by their appearance.
- What did you say?

00:18:04.224 --> 00:18:05.809
Indeed!

00:18:05.959 --> 00:18:07.020
What?

00:18:07.220 --> 00:18:12.116
Make your decision
after you try our cooking.

00:18:12.266 --> 00:18:14.523
Please, Mr. Nelson.

00:18:15.027 --> 00:18:18.058
Give us one more chance.

00:18:18.208 --> 00:18:23.794
Alright.
But if we don't like your food,

00:18:23.944 --> 00:18:26.804
I will throw you guys down the valley!

00:18:37.916 --> 00:18:39.076
Candy...

00:18:39.226 --> 00:18:41.412
Look, the bread is done.

00:18:41.562 --> 00:18:43.313
Archie, cut those carrots
after you finish with the potatoes.

00:18:43.463 --> 00:18:45.391
Also, don't forget the radishes.

00:18:45.691 --> 00:18:47.918
Good work, Archie!

00:18:48.068 --> 00:18:50.553
I hope you like it, Candy.

00:18:51.196 --> 00:18:53.190
But I am still better.

00:18:53.340 --> 00:18:55.324
Candy, don't over burn it!

00:19:08.447 --> 00:19:11.542
We have food today, right?

00:19:11.692 --> 00:19:14.415
It's terrible only having soup.

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:16.885
I am hungry.

00:19:18.157 --> 00:19:19.749
What?

00:19:19.992 --> 00:19:24.855
- You work so hard every day.
- Please, come in and eat!

00:19:25.005 --> 00:19:26.626
Miss...

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:30.005
Candy, we don't need to line up?

00:19:30.155 --> 00:19:35.963
You worked hard all day.
I shouldn't make you line up.

00:19:36.173 --> 00:19:38.066
Please, eat it hot.

00:19:38.216 --> 00:19:40.601
It's like eating in a restaurant.

00:19:48.253 --> 00:19:52.831
- This is good!
- Nice!

00:19:58.531 --> 00:20:01.007
What do you think Mr. Nelson?

00:20:07.307 --> 00:20:10.467
Mr. Nelson's dinner
will be ready in a minute.

00:20:10.617 --> 00:20:13.170
No, that's ok.

00:20:13.645 --> 00:20:15.909
Mr. Nelson...

00:20:21.586 --> 00:20:23.347
You guys come and eat with us.

00:20:23.497 --> 00:20:25.422
What do you think?

00:20:26.825 --> 00:20:31.155
It's the first time I see them
eat so happily.

00:20:31.305 --> 00:20:34.393
You can't eat that leaf.

00:20:34.566 --> 00:20:41.331
Fool, that's for decoration!

00:20:41.481 --> 00:20:44.434
Decoration?
Just like my wife's dishes.

00:20:44.584 --> 00:20:48.070
Aren't you single?

00:20:48.313 --> 00:20:51.908
No, I mean if I had one.

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:05.460
A joyful atmosphere covered the site.

00:21:06.698 --> 00:21:10.093
Belle is on her way to the town

00:21:10.243 --> 00:21:14.070
behind everyone's back.
